        {
          "id": "80f4feea-93bb-346b-a06a-c7eb54bca7f4",
          "content": {
            "id": "80f4feea-93bb-346b-a06a-c7eb54bca7f4",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Oklo, Vistra rise on Meta deal, Opendoor surges on Trump post",
            "description": "<p>US stocks (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI?p=%5EDJI&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^DJI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC?p=%5EIXIC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^IXIC</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC?p=%5EGSPC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^GSPC</a>) are rising on Friday after the<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/jobs-report-us-economy-adds-50000-jobs-in-december-to-cap-worst-year-of-hiring-since-2020-135246067.html\"> December jobs report </a>showed the US added fewer jobs than expected, giving investors hope that Fed will stand pat on rates at its January meeting.\u00a0</p>\n<p>Shares of Oklo (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OKLO\">OKLO</a>) and Vistra (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/VST\">VST</a>) are rising after <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/metas-nuclear-deals-oklo-vistra-145230082.html\">inking nuclear deal</a>s with Meta (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/META\">META</a>).</p>\n<p>Stocks like Opendoor (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OPEN\">OPEN</a>) and Rocket (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RKT\">RKT</a>) are jumping after President Trump instructed his \"representatives\" to <a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/m/56fe37f8-4689-382d-a337-35cd0cfc18f0/real-estate-stocks-jump-on.html\">buy $200 billion in mortgage bonds</a>.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:12;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
            "summary": "US stocks (^DJI, ^IXIC, ^GSPC) are rising on Friday after the December jobs report showed the US added fewer jobs than expected, giving investors hope that Fed will stand pat on rates at its January meeting.&nbsp; Shares of Oklo (OKLO) and Vistra (VST) are rising after inking nuclear deals with Meta (META). Stocks like Opendoor (OPEN) and Rocket (RKT) are jumping after President Trump instructed his \"representatives\" to buy $200 billion in mortgage bonds. Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.",
